    72	
    73	### 3.1 Setup
    74	- Multi-output RandomForestRegressor predicting 8 utilities per record
    75	- Leave-one-seed-out CV (10 folds per family)
    76	- Features: 12 numeric + 3 phase one-hot
    77	- Target: 8 utilities under family_median scale
    78	
